ozTTgemm: Ozaki I/II GEMM for Tenstorrent Blackhole

This distribution contains an independent, adapted copy of the calculation code of
the authors' research repository (not public; paper-data snapshot, revision
63e84a6c179bcf3e2865fb04e82b756aab55d3d6). The host interface, library build, and
execution entry points were written for standalone use. All library source files carry
Apache-2.0 SPDX identifiers. The directory experiments/ is a verbatim copy of the
research programs, scripts and measurement logs at the same snapshot (the authors' own
code, Apache-2.0; most of its source files carry the SPDX identifier, the rest are
covered by this notice). See ORIGIN.md for what was taken and changed, and
SOURCE_MAP.tsv for the original files and their SHA-256 values.

TT-Metalium and its dependencies are external components, distributed separately
under their respective licenses. Their source and binaries are not bundled here.
